ps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-10-22T16:39:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T08:43:16Z","closed_at":"2026-01-28T23:36:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111928","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111928","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111928.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111928.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"With this \"fix\", I removed a workaround that was in the \"**Control::_update_canvas_item_transform()**\" function, that was making the scaling of a control node that has a pivot offset jump around, due to the \"**floor()**\" funciton being called on the position. I'll provide a video of the issue down below, which can also be \"solved\" by disabling \"**snap_controls_to_pixels**\" in the project settings, so the video is recorded in Godot 4.5, where I first found the issue.\r\n\r\nI don't know what that workaround is for, after removing the line, I tried rotating, scaling and changing the pivot offset to check if there was any \"flickering\" as the comment above the workaround suggested, but I couldn't see anything. Maybe I'm wrong, and that workaround is very important, if that's the case, feel free to reject this pull request and I'll resign myself to disabling \"**snap_controls_to_pixels**\" as the solution.\r\n\r\nHere is the video:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7bdbc79-90ec-4bcd-835f-dd9f0f7f962c\r\n\r\nThanks for your time, and sorry if this was unwanted.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111928/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111928/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}